 full text of the top three and judges them again. Structure recovery first decides which line breaks split sentences, then classifies the paragraphs that didn't exist before. And hierarchical classification uses each level's answer to pick the next level's options.","params":{"title":"A second request only when the next question depends on the first","style":"num","items":[{"text":"**New evidence:** rank 182 skills, then fetch the top 3 and re-judge","at":"Skill suggestion"},{"text":"**New state:** rebuild paragraphs, then classify them","at":"Structure recovery"},{"text":"**New options:** each level's answer picks the next level's choices","at":"hierarchical classification"}]},"start":93.638,"dur":30.834,"words":[{"text":"When","s":93.938,"e":94.148},{"text":"is","s":94.178,"e":94.238},{"text":"a","s":94.258,"e":94.338},{"text":"second","s":94.418,"e":94.765},{"text":"request","s":94.818,"e":95.298},{"text":"justified?","s":95.378,"e":96.498},{"text":"Only","s":96.698,"e":96.898},{"text":"when","s":96.978,"e":97.058},{"text":"an","s":97.138,"e":97.218},{"text":"earlier","s":97.298,"e":97.618},{"text":"answer","s":97.698,"e":98.098},{"text":"changes","s":98.258,"e":98.658},{"text":"what","s":98.738,"e":98.818},{"text":"you'd","s":98.898,"e":99.058},{"text":"send","s":99.178,"e":99.298},{"text":"next.","s":99.378,"e":100.258},{"text":"TypeSafe's","s":100.378,"e":100.818},{"text":"cookbooks","s":100.938,"e":101.298},{"text":"have","s":101.378,"e":101.618},{"text":"three","s":101.778,"e":101.938},{"text":"real","s":102.098,"e":102.338},{"text":"cases.","s":102.418,"e":103.258},{"text":"Skill","s":103.538,"e":103.778},{"text":"suggestion","s":103.858,"e":104.418},{"text":"ranks","s":104.498,"e":104.738},{"text":"a","s":104.818,"e":104.898},{"text":"hundred","s":104.978,"e":105.218},{"text":"eighty","s":105.298,"e":105.498},{"text":"two","s":105.538,"e":105.618},{"text":"skills,","s":105.778,"e":106.578},{"text":"then","s":106.698,"e":106.818},{"text":"fetches","s":106.