 an LLM classifier) more\nthan once about the same input. Merge the questions into one request,\nadding speculative questions that later branches might need. Keep a\nsecond request only where the next question's state or options depend\non an earlier answer, and add a comment explaining why. Measure latency\nand input tokens before and after on 20 real inputs."},"start":152.526,"dur":6.906,"words":[{"text":"Try","s":152.826,"e":153.066},{"text":"it.","s":153.146,"e":153.386},{"text":"Have","s":153.706,"e":153.866},{"text":"your","s":153.946,"e":154.026},{"text":"agent","s":154.106,"e":154.346},{"text":"find","s":154.506,"e":154.826},{"text":"and","s":154.906,"e":154.986},{"text":"merge","s":155.066,"e":155.386},{"text":"your","s":155.506,"e":155.626},{"text":"one","s":155.706,"e":155.786},{"text":"question","s":155.946,"e":156.266},{"text":"per","s":156.346,"e":156.426},{"text":"call","s":156.506,"e":156.746},{"text":"loops,","s":156.826,"e":157.306},{"text":"and","s":157.386,"e":157.466},{"text":"measure","s":157.546,"e":157.786},{"text":"the","s":157.866,"e":157.906},{"text":"difference.","s":157.946,"e":158.826}]},{"template":"recap","chapter":"Recap","narration":"So: questions about the same state go in one request. They're evaluated in parallel and independently, so extra questions are nearly free. Ask speculatively, and only make a second request when the next question depends on the first. Next: routing requests to the right handler.","params":{"items":["One state, many questions, one request.","13 questions: 0.27 s and 1.8k tokens vs 3.3 s and 18.9k.","Ask speculative questions; let code ignore the rest.","Second request only when the next question depends on the first."],"next":"Route and cascade","next_at":"Next"},"start":159.432,"dur":20.577,"words":[{"text":"So:","s":159.732,"e":160.372},{"text":"questions","s":160.612,"e":160.852},{"text":"about","s":160.972,"e":161.092},{"text":"the","s":161.172,"e":161.252},{"text":"same","s":161.332,"e":161.572},{"te